			<div class="content" id="post-content-1417912">
									

<p>For your reference on future SCPs (and I think this same shorthand is in one of the documents somewhere):</p>
<p>Safe - lock it in a room, leave it alone, nothing will happen. (A nuclear weapon with no arming device is Safe.)</p>
<p>Euclid - lock it in a room, leave it alone, something might or might not happen. (A nuclear weapon with a remote arming device, when we don't have the remote detonator, is Euclid.)</p>
<p>Keter - lock it in a room, leave it alone, and we're all gonna die. (An armed nuclear weapon, counting down to detonation, is Keter.)</p>
<p>Oh, and no vote yet - this one doesn't grab me as such, but I can see potential there&#8230;</p>

